{'symbol': 'NCLH', 'date': '2020-12-18 16:05:00', 'title': 'NCL CORPORATION LTD. ANNOUNCES CLOSING OF $850,000,000 OF SENIOR NOTES', 'text': "MIAMI, DEC. 18, 2020 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- NCL CORPORATION LTD. (“NCLC”), A SUBSIDIARY OF NORWEGIAN CRUISE LINE HOLDINGS LTD. (NYSE: NCLH), ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS CLOSED ITS PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED PRIVATE OFFERING OF $850 MILLION AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF ITS 5.875% SENIOR NOTES DUE 2026 (THE “NOTES”). NCLC EXPECTS TO USE THE NET PROCEEDS FROM THE OFFERING FOR GENERAL CORPORATE PURPOSES. THE NOTES WILL BE GUARANTEED BY CERTAIN OF NCLC'S SUBSIDIARIES ON A SENIOR UNSECURED BASIS."}